+# Two-point batch order-chart census, D <= 200
+
+Lane: `twopoint-batch-gpt55-20260903`  
+Driver directory: `box/twopoint-batch-20260903/`  
+Main driver: `box/twopoint-batch-20260903/twopoint_order_batch.py`  
+Results: `box/twopoint-batch-20260903/results.json`, `summary.tsv`
+
+## Input seal
