+```text
+FALLACY-v2.md                                      OK
+appendix2-compiler-grok46-20260903.md              OK
+k16-ray-T-newton-sol56-v3-20260903.md              OK
+k16-t2-gate-gpt55-20260903.md                      OK
+moh1983_jram340_configurations_of_roots.pdf         OK
+post-poly-census-grok46-20260903.md                 OK
+prop55k-opus5-20260903.md                           OK
+shape.py                                            OK
+t2_independent_order_system.py                      OK
+t2_independent_order_system.sing                    OK
+t2_order_system.py                                  OK
+```
+
+Artifact hashes at seal time:
